arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750: map the A8xx RSCC registers

The A8xx driver addresses RSCC through the GPU mapping at offset 0x50000.
Expand the SM8750 GPU register range from the 0x60000 our 1165 GPU nodes
carry to the 0x6c000 upstream A8xx devicetrees use, so recovery does not
access beyond the mapping.

From armada 0038a, regenerated against the 1165 node (its base still had
0x40000).

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
@@ -3521,7 +3521,7 @@
 
 		gpu: gpu@3d00000 {
 			compatible = "qcom,adreno-44050000", "qcom,adreno";
-			reg = <0x0 0x03d00000 0x0 0x60000>,
+			reg = <0x0 0x03d00000 0x0 0x6c000>,
 			      <0x0 0x03d9e000 0x0 0x2000>,
 			      <0x0 0x03d61000 0x0 0x800>;
 			reg-names = "kgsl_3d0_reg_memory",
